@startuml

salt
{
  <b>FIND A CONVENTION BY ITS TERMS</b>  { Kind | Terms | Matches | Next }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>1. The kind</b>
      --
      Kind: ^swap^v      Party: ACCOUS
      This kind holds 320 documents that state 201 distinct term sets.
      <i>The server filters by key only. The screen reads the pages itself.</i>
      [ Continue ]
    } | {
      <b>2. The terms I hold</b>
      --
      {#
        Term | Wanted value
        Fixed Calendar | ^AED^v
        Fixed Frequency | ^Annual^v
        Fixed Day Count Fraction | ^ACT/365^v
        Index | (any)v
      }
      <i>A term left as any matches every value.</i>
      [ Back ] | [ Find ]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    {
      <b>3. Matches</b>
      --
      3 documents state these terms. 201 term sets exist in the kind.
      {#
        Key | Index | Float Frequency | Used by
        AED-EIBOR-6M-SWAP | AED-EIBOR-6M | Semi-Annual | 1 set
        AED-EIBOR-3M-SWAP | AED-EIBOR-3M | Quarterly | none
        AED-OIS-SWAP | AED-ON | Annual | none
      }
      Same terms, different key: 2 of the 3 match on every term shown.
      [ Open one ] | [ Back ]
    } | {
      <b>4. No match</b>
      --
      <b>No document in swap states these terms.</b>
      Rows read: 320 of 320.
      --
      [ Author a convention with these terms ] | [ Change the terms ]
    }
  }
}

@enduml
